# Clean public URLs (TO-DOS #82). Rewrite, don't move: files stay under pages/,
# these 200 rules serve them at clean addresses. Destination MUST be extension-less
# (verified S192 on the live rig: a .html destination bounces back via Cloudflare's
# own clean-URL redirect). See work/url-structure/brief.md.
